# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — binary-sign-tool 在 conan buildenv 下需剔除 LD_LIBRARY_PATH ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-09
# Software: 通用（cliquer 1.21 实撞；E077 签名知识的补充面）
# Gate: PR #9035 conan-verify G2 失败链（verify2/verify3 → conan-create.log）
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote / merge into E077
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the evidence below
#   2. Merge the rec into E077.kv（或按新 E0XX.kv 入库）并更新 index.tsv / doc

id:                     DRAFT-binary-sign-tool-buildenv-ldlibrarypath
trigger_tool:           conan|binary-sign-tool|package|llvm-objcopy
phase:                  package
error_signature:        Error relocating .*/binary-sign-tool:.*symbol not found|
                         _ZNSt3__h1.*symbol not found|
                         ConanException: Error 127 while executing
severity:               2
category:               platform, ohos, signing, conan-env
match_keywords:         binary-sign-tool, llvm-objcopy, codesign, selfSign, selfSign 1,
                         LD_LIBRARY_PATH, libc++, relocating, env -u, hnp, XPM,
                         buildenv, ohos-aarch64 profile
root_cause:             ohos-aarch64 profile 的 [buildenv] 将
                         /data/service/hnp/ohos-sdk.org/<sdk>/ohos/native/llvm/lib 前置进
                         LD_LIBRARY_PATH。binary-sign-tool 的 NEEDED libc++.so 指向
                         HarmonyOS 系统 libc++（std::__h 内联命名空间）；该变量使加载器
                         命中 SDK llvm/lib 的 libc++（std::__1，无 __h 符号）→
                         "Error relocating ... symbol not found" 成串出现 → exit 127，
                         conan package() 失败。交互 shell 无该变量，故"手动签成功、
                         conan 内必挂"，极具迷惑性。
affected_scope:         所有在 conan build()/package() 内调用
                         /data/service/hnp/bin/binary-sign-tool（llvm-objcopy 同理）的配方；
                         真机与 CI worker 环境同样成立（只要签名对象存在就触发）。
verification_cmd:       env -u LD_LIBRARY_PATH /data/service/hnp/bin/binary-sign-tool sign -inFile <elf> -outFile <out> -selfSign 1（对照组：带 LD_LIBRARY_PATH 运行必报 relocating）
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           env-unset-library-path
rec_description:        配方内全部签名/objcopy 调用以 `env -u LD_LIBRARY_PATH` 前缀；并保持
                         E077 的顺序（先 llvm-objcopy --remove-section .codesign 剥旧段，
                         再 sign -selfSign 1）；签名必须是链接之后、不再改文件内容的最后一步
                         （strip/重排会令内容哈希失效）。
rec_command:            env -u LD_LIBRARY_PATH /data/service/hnp/bin/binary-sign-tool sign -inFile "{f}" -outFile "{f}" -selfSign 1
rec_auto_fix:           true
rec_impl:               recipe-pattern
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      subprocess-scrubbed-env
fallback_description:   用 subprocess.run([...], env={k: v for k, v in os.environ.items() if k != "LD_LIBRARY_PATH"}) 显式剔除（abbtr/1.0.4 先例）。
forbid_1_pattern:       在 conan 构建环境内裸调用 binary-sign-tool
forbid_1_reason:        profile buildenv 的 LD_LIBRARY_PATH 注入不受配方控制；带变量运行
                         在真机与 CI 都是确定性失败
forbid_1_consequence:   package() 阶段 ConanException Error 127，G2/W3/CI 整轮失败
principles:             P004
similar_to:             E077, E524
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-binary-sign-tool-buildenv-ldlibrarypath.md
last_updated:           2026-09-09
source_event:           archives/c/cliquer/1.21
authors:                B4Q2
source_pr:              #9035
